OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for hit-and-run murder
OL,4,Ain town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered another man by
OL,7,Fdriving into him in a town centre,
OL,8,Fbefore fleeing the scene and trying to
OL,9,Fhide his car, has been jailed.
OL,11,FMatthew Weller, 44, was struck by a VW
OL,12,FPassat in Accrington town centre just
OL,13,Fafter 22:00 BST on 22 April.
OL,15,FMuhammad Haarith, of Exchange Street,
OL,16,FAccrington, had admitted manslaughter
OL,17,Fand denied murder, but was convicted at
OL,18,FPreston Crown Court on Friday.
OL,20,FThe 23-year-old was given a life
OL,21,Fsentence, with a minimum of 16 years
OL,22,Fand five days in prison.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
